        "@value": "{\"actor\":\"the person\",\"kind\":\"permission\",\"modality\":\"may\",\"scope_text\":\"If the waste is listed\",\"summary\":\"If the waste is listed, the person may file a delisting petition under 40 CFR 260.20 and 260.22 to demonstrate to the Administrator that the waste from this particular site or operation is not a hazardous waste.\"}",
