mmary\":\"If the waste is determined to be hazardous, the generator must refer to parts 261, 264, 265, 266, 267, 268, and 273 of chapter I for other possible exclusions or restrictions pertaining to management of the specific waste.\",\"target_ids\":[],\"term_refs\":[],\"typed_values\":[]}",
